      "title": "SHAREHOLDER ALERT: Bronstein Gewirtz & Grossman, LLC Announces Class Action Against Lennar Corporation (NYSE: LEN) — Investors Who Suffered Losses Are Encouraged to Contact the Firm",
      "summary": "A class action lawsuit has been filed against Lennar Corporation (NYSE: LEN) alleging that the company made false and misleading statements regarding its financial performance. The complaint claims Lennar improperly capitalized costs related to land bank option agreements and that its Millrose subsidiary purchased completed homes at above-market prices while renting them at losses, contrary to its stated purpose. These transactions allegedly artificially bolstered reported sales and financial results while concealing weakening home demand. Investors who purchased Lennar securities between February 7, 2025 and October 2, 2026 may be eligible to recover losses, with a lead plaintiff deadline of January 11, 2027.",
      "url": "https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/11/16/3404002/9788/en/shareholder-alert-bronstein-gewirtz-grossman-llc-announces-class-action-against-lennar-corporation-nyse-len-investors-who-suffered-losses-are-encouraged-to-contact-the-firm.html",
